 "app.language.title": "Ulimi",
 "language.filter_hint": "Thayipha ukuze uhlunge",
 "app.about.title": "Mayelana",
 "about.intro.creator": "I-TempleOS yadalwa ngu-Terry A. Davis (1969-2018), owabhala i-kernel yayo, i-compiler, ulimi lwe-HolyC, imidwebo, imidlalo nemibhalo yayo, futhi wayinikela endaweni yomphakathi (public domain).",
 "about.intro.independent": "Lolu hlelo lokusebenza luwukwakhiwa kabusha okuzimele kweselula kwendawo yomsebenzisi ye-TempleOS. Aluyona inguqulo esemthethweni ye-TempleOS, aluhlobene no-Terry A. Davis noma nefa lakhe, futhi aluqalisi i-kernel yangempela ye-TempleOS noma lulingise i-PC.",
 "about.how.title": "Kusebenza kanjani",
 "about.how.body": "Izinhlelo ze-HolyC zisebenza kumhumushi we-HolyC ohlukanisiwe obhalelwe lolu hlelo lokusebenza. Imitapo yolwazi yangempela ye-TempleOS V5.03 yemidwebo, yomsindo, yamamenyu neyezibalo, kanye nemidlalo, imiboniso nemibhalo, ifakwe isuka ku-ISO esemthethweni ye-TempleOS futhi isebenza kulowo mhumushi; imisebenzi embalwa yokudweba esetshenziswa kakhulu isebenza ngokomdabu futhi ihlolwa iphikseli ngephikseli iqhathaniswa nezangempela. Amanye amagama okuqala, kuhlanganise nezithuko nokushiwo okululazayo ngamaqembu abantu, ahlungiwe noma asuswa yile phrojekthi; lezi zinguquko akuwona amagama ka-Terry A. Davis. Ukufakwa komsebenzi wakhe akusho ukuthi kusekelwa zonke izitatimende ezikuwo.",
 "about.additions.title": "Umsebenzi wokuqala nezengezo zesimanje",
 "about.additions.words": "I-{app} iwukuhumusha okungekho emthethweni kwe-TempleOS kweselula, eyadalwa ekuqaleni ngu-Terry A. Davis. Amazwi kaNkulunkulu asekelwe kusistimu ka-Terry A. Davis lokuqala lokukhiqiza amagama: likhetha okufakiwe emagameni akhe esiNgisi (Adam/God/Vocab.DD) ngendlela efanayo nomsebenzi wakhe we-GodWord, futhi lawo magama esiNgisi asala eyisikhombisi. Lolu hlobo lweselula luluqhubekisela phambili ngokuhumushela amagama olimini lwendawo: konke okukhethiwe kungaboniswa ngolimi lohlelo lokusebenza.",
 "about.additions.modern": "Amagama ezilimi eziningi, ukuhumusha kwesixhumi esibonakalayo nezilungiselelo zeselula yizengezo kuphrojekthi le futhi bezingeyona ingxenye ye-TempleOS yokuqala ka-Terry A. Davis. Ukuhumusha kwamagama kwenziwe umshini futhi kungaba namaphutha.",
 "about.credits.title": "Ukubonga",
 "about.credits.templeos": "TempleOS V5.03, izinhlelo, imidlalo, imibhalo: Terry A. Davis (indawo yomphakathi).",
 "about.credits.font": "Ifonti yesistimu (Kernel/FontStd.HC): isuka ku-FreeDOS, indawo yomphakathi (Doc/Credits.DD).",
 "about.credits.kotlin": "Uhlelo lokusebenza lwe-Android: umtapo wolwazi ojwayelekile we-Kotlin, Apache License 2.0.",
 "about.credits.bible": "Umbhalo weBhayibheli (Misc/Bible.TXT): njengoba usatshalaliswa ne-TempleOS.",
 "about.credits.templeos_web": "I-TempleOS-Web ka-ParkerrDev yacwaningwa njengesibonelo sokuziphatha kohlelo; ayikho ikhodi evela kuyo efakiwe.",
 "about.credits.native": "Ukusetshenziswa ngokomdabu: abanikeli be-{app}.",
 "about.credits.translations": "Ukuhumusha kwesixhumi esibonakalayo: kusizwa ngumshini; kungaba namaphutha.",
 "about.privacy.title": "Ubumfihlo",
 "about.privacy.body": "Konke kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Uhlelo lokusebenza alunakho ukufinyelela kunethiwekhi, ama-akhawunti, ukuhlaziya noma izikhangiso. Amafayela akho ahlala kule divayisi.",
